1. Ensure no line exceeds 100 characters. Break long lines appropriately.
2. Remove all trailing whitespace at the end of lines.

The following lines have issues:
- Line 3: too long
- Line 7: trailing whitespace
- Line 8: trailing whitespace and too long
- Line 11: trailing whitespace
